meta {
  name: return stock
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}inventory/stock/return/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    // Chamber location code. Required.
    "location": "A11",

    // Quantity to return, > 0. Required.
    "quantity": "2",

    // Why it's coming back. Required.
    "note": "Two spares not needed",

    // Id of the TAKE movement being returned. Optional but recommended.
    "related_movement": 5
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Returns stock into a chamber (FR-6.4). Any role. `note` is required.

  Link the original take with `related_movement` so the return counts
  against the same project, and so you can't return more than was taken
  (minus earlier returns). With a linked take the chamber can be empty (for
  example after the entry was deleted); without one, the chamber must already
  hold the component.

  Rules shared by every stock operation (FR-6):
  - Locations are chamber codes such as `A11` (case-insensitive).
  - A chamber holds one component type (FR-6.2).
  - Quantities must be greater than zero and whole numbers for units that don't allow fractions.
  - Each operation writes an immutable movement (FR-6.5) and runs with row locks, so concurrent operations can't drive a chamber below zero (FR-6.11).
  - The response has the `movement` and the resulting `stock_entries`.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Stock returned.",
    "movement": {
      "id": 6,
      "movement_type": "RETURN",
      "movement_type_display": "Return",
      "component": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
        "part_number": "JGB37-520",
        "unit_symbol": "pcs"
      },
      "source_location": null,
      "destination_location": "A11",
      "quantity": "2.000",
      "quantity_before": null,
      "quantity_after": null,
      "unit_price": null,
      "delivery_charge": null,
      "performed_by": {
        "id": 3,
        "username": "nadia.islam",
        "email": "nadia.islam@example.com",
        "role": "STAFF"
      },
      "project": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Line Follower Robot",
        "status": "ACTIVE"
      },
      "related_movement": 5,
      "note": "Two spares not needed",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.655904+06:00"
    },
    "stock_entries": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "location": "A11",
        "chamber": 1,
        "component": {
          "id": 1,
          "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
          "part_number": "JGB37-520",
          "unit_symbol": "pcs"
        },
        "quantity": "36.000",
        "note": "",
        "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.591057+06:00",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.655244+06:00"
      }
    ]
  }

  More than is left on the linked take (400):
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Only 4 pcs of that take can still be returned."
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
